{
  "name": "dsh-desktop-pet",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DSH 桌面宠物：Web GUI 右下角一只纯 CSS 像素小宠，状态机驱动 idle/walk/sleep/happy/eat/typing/work 等动作；支持点击、拖拽、双击喂食，并通过 MutationObserver 联动会话状态（AI 输出中 cheering、工具执行中 work、空闲自动睡觉）。纯 client DOM 注入，位置记忆到 localStorage，热插拔不改 DSH 源码。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "pet",
    "desktop-pet",
    "animation",
    "sprite"
  ],
  "author": "xujiping",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/xujiping/dsh-plugins.git",
    "directory": "packages/dsh-desktop-pet"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/xujiping/dsh-plugins/tree/main/packages/dsh-desktop-pet",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/xujiping/dsh-plugins/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ]
}
